    {
      "s": 7.22,
      "e": 18.2,
      "text": "That view of Orion from the Acana, 25,000 feet,"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.2,
      "e": 25.17,
      "text": "time to splash down, less than four minutes."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.17,
      "e": 30.01,
      "text": "Forward Bay cover has been deployed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.01,
      "e": 38.95,
      "text": "droves have been deployed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.95,
      "e": 46.04,
      "text": "great video from the Acana,"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.04,
      "e": 59.48,
      "text": "15,000 feet until splashdown."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.48,
      "e": 74.42,
      "text": "Coming up on main shoot deploy,"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.42,
      "e": 76.42,
      "text": "from a waypoint over the Pacific Ocean,"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.42,
      "e": 83.6,
      "text": "there is your new spacecraft, America."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.6,
      "e": 88.34,
      "text": "Jokes away, main shoot deploy."
    },
    {
      "s": 88.5,
      "e": 91.74,
      "text": "On mains, everything looking good."
    },
    {
      "s": 91.74,
      "e": 127.16,
      "text": "Good reefing reported, 4,000 feet,"
    },
    {
      "s": 127.16,
      "e": 132.82,
      "text": "three good main shoots reported from the USS Anchorage."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.82,
      "e": 137.64,
      "text": "That's confirmed here in mission control,"
    },
    {
      "s": 137.64,
      "e": 143.34,
      "text": "from a high speed rate of 20,000 miles an hour"
    },
    {
      "s": 143.34,
      "e": 145.94,
      "text": "to a gentle return back to Earth,"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.94,
      "e": 148.78,
      "text": "more than four hours and 20 minutes after it took off"
    },
    {
      "s": 148.78,
      "e": 151.68,
      "text": "on a Delta IV heavy rocket from the Cape Canaveral Air Force"
    },
    {
      "s": 151.68,
      "e": 198.22,
      "text": "Station, 3,200 feet now until splashdown."
    },
    {
      "s": 198.22,
      "e": 216.17,
      "text": "2,200 feet now, winds at the surface,"
    },
    {
      "s": 216.17,
      "e": 220.81,
      "text": "just about 12 knots, wave heights no more than about 4.5 feet"
    },
    {
      "s": 220.81,
      "e": 250.66,
      "text": "or so, perfect conditions for Orion's homecoming."
    },
    {
      "s": 250.66,
      "e": 254.18,
      "text": "This view from Orion itself of the shoots,"
    },
    {
      "s": 254.18,
      "e": 259.14,
      "text": "helping it to descend gently towards its splashdown"
    },
    {
      "s": 259.14,
      "e": 290.41,
      "text": "of the Pacific, 1,000 feet, just a few hundred feet"
    },
    {
      "s": 290.41,
      "e": 300.72,
      "text": "until splashdown."
    },
    {
      "s": 300.72,
      "e": 313.27,
